<blockquote>
<p>The image was taken by myself, with my own phone, of a pizza I ordered.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I hope it tasted pretty good, because it <em>looks</em> terrible.</p>
<p>As a former pizza cook, I'd honestly have been more than a bit ashamed to send that out for delivery. The toppings are an absolute mess, what appear to be bacon strips are practically charcoal, the crust is unevenly cooked&#8230;it makes me sad to look at it. Plus, bacon should always be small pieces, not strips, so it can be spread evenly over the whole pizza.</p>
<p>(Not joking even a little bit. Even when we were slammed we never made a pizza that looked like that. But we were consistently one of the highest rated shops of the local chain I worked for.)</p>
<p>((EDIT: Which, now that I think about it, bringing that up is funny, because I started reading the SCP wiki during that time period, and introduced a number of my coworkers to it via the shop computer during slow periods.))</p>

